        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 147  57 Inch Stainless Steel Commercial Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 56\" Center to Center (CTC)  stainless steel commercial door pull is made from 1\" diameter solid round bar stock. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school, or store front doors. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-147_size.pdf?v=1718159560\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 22 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 147  57\" Commercial Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 56\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 57\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Satin Stainless Steel finish</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
